\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Species studied here grouped by growth speed and wood anatomy. We collected the growth speed information for each species from \cite {burns_silvics_1990} and the wood anatomy from different sources \citep {cheng_superblack_2024,dorangeville_peak_2022,grover_growth_2023}. We sampled a total of 49 individual trees}}{22}{table.caption.15}%
